    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM A SINGLE TAP TO A VAST WORLD - BUILD IT YOUR WAY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e5b9cfd0d8f74b8ecebb58ddd2197729.poster.avif?t=1753805606\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e5b9cfd0d8f74b8ecebb58ddd2197729.webm?t=1753805606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e5b9cfd0d8f74b8ecebb58ddd2197729.mp4?t=1753805606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Mine Idle Craft </strong>\u00a0- a vibrant 3D idle-sandbox adventure where your only limits are the ones you don\u2019t break. Whether you're the kind of player who can't stop tapping or someone who loves to sit back and watch progress unfold, this is your perfect blend of action and automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're dropped into a dynamic world rich with resources, secrets, and opportunities. Every tap mines a block. Every block builds your legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY THAT GROWS WITH YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e746aa054ea560fa55bce5116c958f76.poster.avif?t=1753805606\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e746aa054ea560fa55bce5116c958f76.webm?t=1753805606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e746aa054ea560fa55bce5116c958f76.mp4?t=1753805606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83e\ude93 <strong>Start Small, Scale Big</strong> \u2013 Begin with a handful of tools and a patch of land. Mine resources, refine materials, and expand your base from a humble shack to an advanced industrial complex.<br>\u2022 \u2699\ufe0f <strong>Automate Everything</strong> \u2013 Set up smart systems to mine, craft, and produce even while you're away. Your empire never sleeps - unless you want it to.<br>\u2022 \ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Craft with Purpose</strong> \u2013 Create machines, tools, and structures that make your world run smoother, faster, and smarter. Optimize, redesign, repeat.<br>\u2022 \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Unlock &amp; Expand</strong> \u2013 Discover new zones, gather rare resources, and push the edge of your map further with each breakthrough.<br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfae <strong>Play Active or Idle</strong> \u2013 Whether you're a hands-on builder or a chill overseer, <strong>Mine Idle Craft</strong> adapts to your pace. Dive deep into hands-on gameplay or kick back and watch your base flourish.<br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Explore with Style</strong> \u2013 Sprint, jump, and glide across your world. Parkour through tight spaces, or climb to towering heights. Exploration is as fun as expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHY MINE IDLE CRAFT?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it\u2019s more than just mining - it\u2019s about <strong>mastering momentum</strong>. From the joy of your first crafted pickaxe to the moment you realize your base is running itself, <strong>every step feels earned - and rewarding</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers. No pressure. Just progress, your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Ready to turn raw blocks into brilliance?<br>Start your journey now - Mine, Build, Automate, and Rule in <i>Mine Idle Craft!</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM A SINGLE TAP TO A VAST WORLD - BUILD IT YOUR WAY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e5b9cfd0d8f74b8ecebb58ddd2197729.poster.avif?t=1753805606\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e5b9cfd0d8f74b8ecebb58ddd2197729.webm?t=1753805606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e5b9cfd0d8f74b8ecebb58ddd2197729.mp4?t=1753805606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Mine Idle Craft </strong>\u00a0- a vibrant 3D idle-sandbox adventure where your only limits are the ones you don\u2019t break. Whether you're the kind of player who can't stop tapping or someone who loves to sit back and watch progress unfold, this is your perfect blend of action and automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're dropped into a dynamic world rich with resources, secrets, and opportunities. Every tap mines a block. Every block builds your legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY THAT GROWS WITH YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e746aa054ea560fa55bce5116c958f76.poster.avif?t=1753805606\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e746aa054ea560fa55bce5116c958f76.webm?t=1753805606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698130/extras/e746aa054ea560fa55bce5116c958f76.mp4?t=1753805606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83e\ude93 <strong>Start Small, Scale Big</strong> \u2013 Begin with a handful of tools and a patch of land. Mine resources, refine materials, and expand your base from a humble shack to an advanced industrial complex.<br>\u2022 \u2699\ufe0f <strong>Automate Everything</strong> \u2013 Set up smart systems to mine, craft, and produce even while you're away. Your empire never sleeps - unless you want it to.<br>\u2022 \ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Craft with Purpose</strong> \u2013 Create machines, tools, and structures that make your world run smoother, faster, and smarter. Optimize, redesign, repeat.<br>\u2022 \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Unlock &amp; Expand</strong> \u2013 Discover new zones, gather rare resources, and push the edge of your map further with each breakthrough.<br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfae <strong>Play Active or Idle</strong> \u2013 Whether you're a hands-on builder or a chill overseer, <strong>Mine Idle Craft</strong> adapts to your pace. Dive deep into hands-on gameplay or kick back and watch your base flourish.<br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Explore with Style</strong> \u2013 Sprint, jump, and glide across your world. Parkour through tight spaces, or climb to towering heights. Exploration is as fun as expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHY MINE IDLE CRAFT?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it\u2019s more than just mining - it\u2019s about <strong>mastering momentum</strong>. From the joy of your first crafted pickaxe to the moment you realize your base is running itself, <strong>every step feels earned - and rewarding</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers. No pressure. Just progress, your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Ready to turn raw blocks into brilliance?<br>Start your journey now - Mine, Build, Automate, and Rule in <i>Mine Idle Craft!</i></strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Dig deep, dream big. In Mine Idle Craft, you\u2019ll shape your own evolving world - one tap at a time. Mine, craft, and automate your way from a modest camp to a fully functional mega-base across a beautiful blocky universe that grows as fast as your ambition.",
